      <p begin="01:49.660" end="01:53.210" ttm:agent="v1">What OVO for? The &quot;Other Vaginal Option&quot;? Pussy</p>

      <p begin="01:53.210" end="01:55.650" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga better straighten they posture, got famous all up in Compton</p>

      <p begin="01:55.650" end="01:57.950" ttm:agent="v1">Might write this for the docket, tell the pop star, &quot;Quit hidin'&quot;</p>

