      <p begin="02:13.420" end="02:15.890" ttm:agent="v1">That name gotta be registered and placed on neighborhood watch</p>

      <p begin="02:15.890" end="02:18.190" ttm:agent="v1">I lean on you niggas like another line of Wock'</p>

      <p begin="02:18.190" end="02:20.720" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, it's all eyes on me, and I'ma send it up to Pac, ayy</p>

      <p begin="02:20.720" end="02:22.950" ttm:agent="v1">Put the wrong label on me, I'ma get 'em dropped, ayy</p>

