      <p begin="02:32.540" end="02:34.900" ttm:agent="v1">Freaky-ass niggas need to stay they ass inside, ayy</p>

      <p begin="02:34.900" end="02:37.330" ttm:agent="v1">Roll they ass up like a fresh pack of 'za, ayy</p>

      <p begin="02:37.330" end="02:39.850" ttm:agent="v1">City is back up, it's a must, we outside, ayy</p>

