      <p begin="02:58.610" end="03:00.820" ttm:agent="v1">Atlanta was the Mecca, buildin' railroads and trains</p>

      <p begin="03:00.820" end="03:03.420" ttm:agent="v1">Bear with me for a second, let me put y'all on game</p>

      <p begin="03:03.420" end="03:05.610" ttm:agent="v1">The settlers was usin' town folk to make 'em richer</p>

